flowchart TD
    Q[Query Vector] --> ENTRY[Enter HNSW graph at top layer]
    ENTRY --> NAV[Greedy nearest-neighbor navigation, layer by layer]
    NAV --> FILTER{ACL / metadata pre-filter}
    FILTER -->|matches| CAND[Candidate Set]
    FILTER -->|excluded| SKIP[Skip - never enters candidate set]
    CAND --> EF[ef_search controls how many candidates explored]
    EF --> TOPK[Top-K by similarity]
